WEBVTT

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:08.420
In short, medicinal herbs growing wild
by the roadside are unsanitary to use,

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:10.270
so unless it's an emergency...

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:15.640
Unless it's... an emergency...

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:22.920
Mao-chan?!

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:24.420
Sensei?!

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:24.420
Mao-chan-sensei?!

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:24.420
Mao-sensei?!

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.210
Mao-chan, what's wrong?

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.560
She has a terrible fever!

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:33.100
Please leave this to me, Hero.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:33.930
Rona-chan!

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:36.860
It's important to remain calm
 in moments like this.

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:38.440
Don't panic, and don't rush.

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:41.930
Yes! Let's build the ultimate 
hospital here, right away!

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:44.690
I think you've gone full circle
 into panic territory!

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:47.440
Let's get her to the nurse's office for now.

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:51.320
The way you can make just the 
right decision always amazes me.

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.030
I have the results of your exam.

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:00.960
That look...

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:03.710
I see. It figures.

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:07.210
I had a feeling it would come to this one day.

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:10.420
This is terribly hard for me to tell you, but...

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.220
I know my body best of all.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:19.630
I'm prepared to accept anything, 
so just tell me the truth.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:22.220
I won't blame you for it.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:25.520
Mao-sensei, you're dealing with...

00:01:26.490 --> 00:01:28.610
Demon Lord Fever!

00:01:29.110 --> 00:01:31.040
"Demon Lord Fever"?!

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:45.790
Endro!

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:16.320
<i>Calling it "Demon Lord Fever" because 
even a Demon Lord can't escape it...</i>

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:18.570
<i>Humans sure have a way with names.</i>

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:24.080
<i>Still, to think even I, one who gave up 
being the Demon Lord, would fall ill...</i>

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:28.470
<i>No, maybe this is my just punishment 
for casting aside my duty.</i>

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:31.600
Mao-chan Last Night

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:39.350
Refill of strawberry juice!

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:43.870
I'm home now!

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:46.940
Off, off, off!

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:54.100
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:57.760
<i>I have no idea how I could have caught this,
 so there's nothing to be done.</i>

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:02.820
<i>I guess I just have to accept it as 
a punishment being dealt to me.</i>

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:08.270
It's a pain, but... oh, well.

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:12.020
There's never been any wonder drug for it,

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:18.150
so the only cure is to stay warm
 and get plenty of rest and nutrition.

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:21.970
Demon Lord Fever is terrifying!

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:28.520
I know this is my fault,
 but I still can't believe it.

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:32.730
I suppose I should at least 
be cooking for myself.

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:36.690
Huh? What's this?

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:40.990
It's the drop we got from the honey boo 
monster during that outdoor practical.

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:43.840
It's honey packed full of nutrients!

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:50.810
This is all I have left?

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:53.110
Well, it's better than nothing.

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:56.260
Lick.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:59.820
So sweet!

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:03.390
They say this honey provides 
complete nutrition.

00:05:03.390 --> 00:05:06.320
With this, I can fight off Demon Lord Fever.

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:09.340
Lick, lick, lick.

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:19.380
I'm so miserable.

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:25.630
What on earth am I doing here, all by myself,
 instead of being the Demon Lord?

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:31.070
If only I hadn't been sent into the past
 during my battle with the Hero!

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:37.770
Well, when I think about it, there's not 
much difference between then and now.

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:46.190
Have you awakened, new Demon Lord?

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.160
And you are?

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:54.000
I am a golem created to serve the Demon Lord.

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:58.790
Demon Lord, have you finished 
recovering your memories?

00:05:58.910 --> 00:06:02.520
Yes, I'd like to say I'm completely done,

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:07.550
but with 3,000 years worth of memories,

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:09.930
some of the details are still vague.

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:11.870
That's to be expected.

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:16.250
This is your 999th resurrection, after all.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:19.480
And when the Demon Lord 
is resurrected in this land,

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:23.230
a Hero also appears to take them down, huh?

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:29.570
If the legends are true, then we've 
now been defeated 998 times.

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:34.950
Hmph. It's as if we're being 
resurrected only to be defeated.

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:40.330
I have confidence that you can achieve 
victory this time, Demon Lord.

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:41.960
Very well.

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:45.840
In that case, you may begin guiding me
 toward becoming a true Demon Lord.

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:47.050
Of course.

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:49.080
That is what I'm here for.

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:51.520
What are those?

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:53.160
Glasses.

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:54.470
I will be your teacher.

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:56.680
Really?

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:58.350
Indeed.

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:03.360
What is the weakness of the second 
tail of a five-tailed dragon?

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:05.800
That's easy. It's fire.

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:07.990
That is the weakness of its fourth tail.

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:12.620
The correct answer is that 
the base of the tail is ticklish.

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:15.620
That's not even the same type of weakness!

00:07:16.020 --> 00:07:19.430
Tom-kun harvests 300 from his fields.

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:23.250
If he is taxed at 30%,
how much does he pay in taxes?

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:26.060
That's ridiculous. He pays 90.

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:27.130
Incorrect.

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:30.790
Tom-kun pays no taxes
 and flees into the night

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:32.890
after the Demon Lord burns all his fields.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:34.640
Am I some tyrant?

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:36.890
You are the Demon Lord.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:41.770
The Demon Lord's Four Generals shall serve 
as your partners for combat training.

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:44.100
Demon Lord, prepare yourself!

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:50.110
Are my Four Generals nothing but small fry?!

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:59.160
I'll allow it. Join me for dinner.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:02.290
A servant is never permitted to do that.

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:05.820
I see.

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:09.630
Go forth, my subordinates!

00:08:09.850 --> 00:08:13.890
This time, our Demon Lord Army 
shall seize Naral Island!

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:32.610
I am just a gargoyle in a birdcage.

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:35.180
But one day, I shall take flight

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:38.240
into that pitch-black night full of miasma.

00:08:39.940 --> 00:08:43.020
I am the Demon Lord, waited upon by all,

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:44.620
so why...

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:48.350
Why do I feel so unfulfilled?

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:51.760
You say the Hero has appeared?!

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:54.260
A student at the adventurer school

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:56.760
drew the sacred sword and 
departed with her friends.

00:08:57.210 --> 00:08:59.310
I see. At long last!

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.310
That makes you smile, Demon Lord?

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:06.320
I was smiling?

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:10.940
The Hero's here!

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:12.130
Yes.

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:14.610
They've defeated the Four Generals 
sent to intercept them

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:17.340
and are heading straight here
 for you, Demon Lord.

00:09:17.340 --> 00:09:19.230
I shall go intercept them, as well.

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:20.890
Wait.

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:23.290
What is it?

00:09:24.900 --> 00:09:27.420
No, forget it.

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:30.530
Then please excuse me, my Lord.

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:36.080
Even if I wanted to stop her,

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.880
I don't even know her name...

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:45.080
I guess in the end, I'm all alone.

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:55.770
I applaud you for reaching me, Heroes.

00:09:57.620 --> 00:10:00.420
I was this close to conquering Naral Island

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:04.770
and putting an end to my life in 
the lonely Demon Lord's Castle...

00:10:11.850 --> 00:10:16.680
Why does the Hero have 
to be someone so clueless?

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:21.320
Who could it be at a time like this?

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:25.180
Mao-chan!

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:27.640
Please, don't die!

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:31.350
Oh, nice lock, Yu-chan!

00:10:31.350 --> 00:10:33.460
You should have her beat in three seconds!

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:34.840
Hey, hey, hey!

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:37.330
Calm down and loosen your grip, Yusha!

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:40.240
Come on! Mao-sensei's trying to tap out!

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:42.000
Break away from her!

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:42.700
Now fight!

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:45.410
You need to calm down 
yourself, Seira-san.

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:49.420
You all really are clueless!

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:53.920
Roll 6

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:56.290
<i>ENDRO!</i>

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:02.870
Are you all right, Mao-chan?

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:07.900
I was doing fairly well 
until you all barged in.

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:11.310
I found some honey boo's 
honey on the ground!

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:12.890
It's so sweet!

00:11:12.890 --> 00:11:13.690
That's...

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:16.280
G-Give it back!

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:19.450
That's the only hope I have left!

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:23.370
My final hope for nutrition!

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:26.910
Your final hope? But it seems 
there was hardly any left.

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:30.280
You want to lick some too, Mao-chan-sensei?

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:31.320
Here!

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:37.510
It tickles when you lick like that!

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:40.260
You want to taste some, too?

00:11:41.650 --> 00:11:43.300
Okay, here!

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:48.520
Is that even sanitary?

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:52.600
Mao-chan looks really uncomfortable.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:57.430
When I caught Demon Lord Fever
 as a child, I recovered right away...

00:11:57.430 --> 00:11:58.280
I know!

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:02.440
Hey, let's cure her Demon Lord Fever
 really quickly with a Cartado!

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:04.030
That's impossible.

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:07.810
You can heal wounds with Cartado,
 but not cure illnesses.

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:09.540
That's just how they are.

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:11.060
I see.

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:14.330
I guess you can't just use 
Cartado for everything, huh?

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:17.550
Oh, that's kind of cute.

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:19.020
Hey, Yu-chan.

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:22.240
I'm sure it's not because Cartado lack power,

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:24.550
but because mothers are incredible!

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:27.810
Mothers? Oh!

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:28.750
Oh!

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:47.450
What?

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:50.430
I've had enough of your visit, so go home now.

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:52.330
Please.

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:53.990
We've made up our minds!

00:12:53.990 --> 00:12:56.120
Since you're always taking care of us,

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:59.000
we're going to look after you
 the way a mother would!

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:01.360
Wh-What?!

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:04.170
<i>Th-These guys are going to look after me?</i>

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:06.340
<i>What's going to happen to me?!</i>

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:12.230
<i>Have these girls realized I'm the 
Demon Lord and come to end me?!</i>

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:19.730
Mao-chan, does that feel good?

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:21.400
Y-Yeah.

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:23.740
When you've been sweating.
you need to wipe it off.

00:13:24.020 --> 00:13:26.030
Th-That's true.

00:13:28.050 --> 00:13:29.490
I'm back!

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:34.000
I brought some good restorative fruits
 and mushrooms I picked in the forest.

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:36.180
Mei-chan, is this enough?

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:37.410
That's plenty.

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:39.590
Healthshrooms and easilydigestiseeds...

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:41.000
And chicken, too.

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:43.410
So with that...

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:44.960
Change!

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:49.860
Young wife mode!

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:53.510
I'll make some food that's easy to keep down.

00:13:56.120 --> 00:14:00.660
Mei-chan's the most feminine 
one in this Hero's party!

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:03.650
She can cook, clean, and sew, too.

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:06.650
<i>This girl's full of surprises!</i>

00:14:07.340 --> 00:14:09.530
Well, I guess I'll clean her roo—

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.380
Seira-chan, you stay still.

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.380
Sei-chan, you stay still.

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:12.290
This again?!

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:14.560
We'll do the cleaning.

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:15.480
Yeah!

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:23.300
Chibi... You and I are friends, right?

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:27.570
Chibi? What are you...

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:31.300
Ch-Chibi-san?

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:37.200
Hey, what did you just eat?

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:39.850
No, wait, never mind! 
Uh, why are you coming this way?!

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:40.710
Stop!

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:44.320
Don't open your mouth and show me!

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:47.070
Mommy!

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:49.820
Are you okay, Seira-san?

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:50.970
Mei...

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:54.660
It seems that Mao-sensei's having 
trouble eating on her own,

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:57.460
so I'd like you to feed her.
Would you mind?

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:00.800
Sure, I will!

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:05.860
Is this really my home?

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:09.550
Didn't recognize it, did you?

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:11.260
Here, Mao-sensei.

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:12.680
Here's your food!

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.700
R-Right.

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:16.410
Say "ah."

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:25.900
<i>What is this? I feel oddly warm.</i>

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:28.270
<i>Is it because of the fever?</i>

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:30.280
Mao-chan's Memory

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:33.780
Where am I?

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:37.080
I was just fighting the Heroes...

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:41.420
Oh, sorry, young lady.

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:42.870
Are you hurt?

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:44.610
How dare you?!

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:46.920
Taste the power of the Demon Lord!

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:52.550
What's the meaning of this?

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:55.280
Oh, that's what you're doing.

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:57.130
What's so funny, human?!

00:15:57.130 --> 00:15:58.880
My, how scary.

00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:01.600
I see. So you're the Demon Lord, huh?

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:02.560
What am I to do?

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:06.080
The Hero has yet to appear, after all.

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:09.690
You would insul— What?

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:11.820
There's no Hero?

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:13.970
I see.

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:15.940
I think I've grasped the general idea.

00:16:15.940 --> 00:16:20.880
At present, there's no Hero here on 
Naral Island, let alone a Demon Lord.

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:22.270
Now, why is that?

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:26.560
It would seem that I've 
been sent to the past.

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:29.280
And it must've been because... of that.

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:37.820
But time travel is impossible, 
save for Creator-class gods.

00:16:37.820 --> 00:16:42.560
Just how badly did that dimwit 
Hero screw up for this to happen?!

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:47.120
Still, this isn't all bad.

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:50.280
Fortunately, I possess my 
memories of the future.

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:54.900
If I use those, I might be able to 
prevent the birth of the Hero.

00:16:54.900 --> 00:16:56.160
However...

00:16:56.480 --> 00:16:59.100
Whether it's because the Hero's magic failed

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:01.730
or because I've traveled back in time,

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:04.290
my power has been dramatically weakened.

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:07.740
I'll need rest in order to recover my power.

00:17:07.740 --> 00:17:09.110
To do that...

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:12.800
I'll need to procure a base and a job!

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:16.300
Adventurer's Guild

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:19.230
I am the Dem—Mao!

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:22.060
Foolish humans of the Adventurer's Guild!

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:26.220
You will obediently find me 
a suitable job and residence!

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:29.940
We don't have any good quests at the moment.

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:33.440
Here, eat this and go play outside, okay?

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:37.480
Oh? How admirable of you to present tribute.

00:17:38.560 --> 00:17:39.950
I shall return!

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:45.080
Curses! At this point,
 I'll have to try everything!

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:05.780
Why can I not find a base or a job?

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:09.610
And why does everyone keep giving me candy?

00:18:10.260 --> 00:18:13.860
Frankly, candy isn't going to fill my stomach.

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:23.490
To think the great Demon Lord
 would be taken down by hunger...

00:18:33.030 --> 00:18:34.870
Oh, you're awake?

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:38.470
Don't "You're awake?" me.

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:42.140
Why are you carrying me under your arm?

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:47.850
When you spot a cute young girl
 collapsed on the road, you take her in!

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:51.860
How can she have such clear, unwavering eyes?!

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:56.020
Well, I found you while I was on a quest,
 so I couldn't leave you alone.

00:18:56.020 --> 00:19:00.490
Why do I get the feeling I would've 
been safer if you had left me alone?

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:02.560
Would you put me down?!

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:06.500
Sure. I certainly couldn't 
fight like this, anyway.

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:07.500
Huh?

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:10.880
A five-tailed dragon?!

00:19:11.220 --> 00:19:13.630
When you mentioned a quest, did you mean—

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:20.390
You sure know a lot for a little one.

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:21.920
Have some candy.

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:23.260
You, too?!

00:19:24.570 --> 00:19:26.520
Wait, we don't have time for this!

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:27.160
Right!

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:34.520
Gaia Gate!

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:38.530
Wow, I've recovered quite a bit.

00:19:39.380 --> 00:19:41.660
Candy's surprisingly amazing.

00:19:41.920 --> 00:19:43.100
You're...

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:45.120
Come on! Let's defeat it already!

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:48.910
If this keeps up, I won't have enough 
candy—I mean, magic power!

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:51.670
But that's a powerful foe.

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:54.750
So you just have to go for its weaknesses.

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:56.920
Go tickle the base of its second tail.

00:19:57.400 --> 00:20:00.260
If you do that, it'll calm down immediately.

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:01.180
All right.

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:02.930
Then let's go.

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:06.850
Wait, why?!

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:11.230
You saved me today.

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:15.740
To think you already have such knowledge
and might when you're so young.

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:18.610
But of course!

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:22.740
So on that note, how would 
you like to be a teacher?

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:24.300
A teacher?

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:27.990
I work as a teacher
 at the adventurer school.

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:29.120
Would you like to, as well?

00:20:29.650 --> 00:20:33.100
<i>Why should the Demon 
Lord raise adventurers</i>

00:20:33.100 --> 00:20:35.530
<i>when one of them will 
become the future Hero?</i>

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:37.750
Sorry, but I—

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:40.370
Also, the adventurer school 
is run by the kingdom.

00:20:40.370 --> 00:20:41.350
The kingdom?!

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:45.970
You mean... I'd be... a public 
official with a stable income?

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:46.620
Yes.

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:53.420
If you don't mind, I would 
love to accept that offer.

00:21:01.870 --> 00:21:05.130
Why are you sleeping with me?

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:07.620
Because a little girl was sleeping here.

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:12.120
This woman keeps saying that
 with such clear, unwavering eyes!

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:14.940
Oh, my body feels light!

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:16.440
That's good to hear.

00:21:16.840 --> 00:21:21.220
The girls who went home when 
I came in were worried about you.

00:21:21.220 --> 00:21:22.570
They were?

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:28.680
She's like a baby,
 falling asleep while she eats!

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:30.100
So cute!

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:32.810
Her complexion's looking much better, too.

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:34.730
Please take care of the rest for us!

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:37.170
Of course. You can leave it to me.

00:21:37.780 --> 00:21:41.040
You all love Mao-sensei, don't you?

00:21:45.060 --> 00:21:46.320
I see.

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:53.380
It's gone cold.

00:21:53.380 --> 00:21:54.760
I should heat it.

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:57.200
No.

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:04.100
It's warm.

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.940
Princess Rona, Fight On!

00:23:35.960 --> 00:23:38.640
"Princess Rona, Fight On!"
